stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending
  pending --> reviewed: Open difference
  reviewed --> accepting: Accept exact choices
  accepting --> unknown: Response lost
  accepting --> accepted: Commit guarded append
  unknown --> accepted: Retry original request
  accepting --> source_changed: Client saved newer version
  unknown --> source_changed: Reload after conflict
  source_changed --> reviewed: Review again
  reviewed --> kept: Keep mine
  accepted --> accepted: Retry original receipt
  pending --> pending: Deduplicate proposal version signal
  reviewed --> retired: Access or publication retired
